@startuml
title AgentFlow — proposed draft component diagram (no implementation)
left to right direction
actor "API client" as Client
component "Evaluation harness\n(planned research tool)" as Harness
rectangle "AgentFlow — four proposed application services" {
  component "API gateway" as Gateway
  component "Authentication service" as Auth
  component "AI orchestration service\nDialogue + policy/approval\nTool dispatch + adapters" as AI
  component "Database service" as DB
  database "PostgreSQL" as PG
}
cloud "External LLM provider" as LLM
cloud "Optional integration APIs" as Integrations
Client --> Gateway : HTTP/JSON
Harness --> Gateway : synthetic requests
Gateway --> Auth : internal HTTP
Gateway --> AI : internal HTTP
Auth --> DB : gRPC
AI --> DB : gRPC
DB --> PG : SQL
AI --> LLM : model API
AI --> Integrations : validated tool operations
note bottom of AI
  All components and controls are planned.
  Policy, ownership, approval and idempotency
  must be implemented and verified.
end note
@enduml
